  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In many group events, sometimes people place portals in inconvenient locations like choke points, close to spawn, or in music events close to the stage; this is a really major inconvenience to people trying to enjoy an event they are attending in game.\n\nAdditionally, some worlds are quite trolly and someone might enter a portal accidentally.\n\nSome worlds already allow portal management in where you can or can't place a portal, allow us to do the same for group moderation sake.\n\nPlease allow us, as group moderators, to help our guests to enjoy our events to the best of our ability.",
